00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:50.950
Chapter 8 Love

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:27.760
Don't worry, it's a shallow wound.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.120
You can laugh at me.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:32.250
For what?

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:36.580
A wound on the shoulder, received
while fleeing, is a disgrace for a warrior.

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:38.920
Since when have you been a warrior?

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.080
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:46.660
For us, who have long lived as Oniwaban
and spies in the service of the Shogunate,

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:48.540
what determines victory or defeat

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:51.080
is how accurately and swiftly we bring back

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:54.220
the information that our
master desires, and only that.

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:58.160
No matter how many wounds
we may get while fleeing,

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.360
or even if we are killed like street dogs.

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.580
I know.

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:03.760
I know that!

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.620
Hey, this is not a laughing matter!

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:13.580
Oh, no, if we can't laugh at this, what are
we supposed to laugh at, puppy boy?

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:17.950
Negotiating directly with Mr. Hijikata
was bound to be useless.

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:19.760
But there was nothing else I could do!

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:24.250
You're getting all worked up, but what are
you going to do once you get your own sword?

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:26.950
It's not a problem of what I'm
going to do with it and stuff!

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.350
It's not?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:33.940
The sword at your hip's always been
considered the soul of a warrior, right?!

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.860
It's a matter of feeling! Feeling!

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:39.040
I got it.

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:40.200
If you're going to go that far,

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.580
then I'll take care of it for you somehow.

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.080
Really?

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:47.620
Yeah, just wait here for a bit.

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:48.920
Here!

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.330
It's long, man.
Yeah, it's long.

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:05.050
Too long.

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.270
It's a bamboo sword.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:22.150
If it's a problem of how you feel,
then a bamboo sword will do, right?

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.700
Hey, isn't that great?!

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.620
It looks like a respectable
sword from the outside.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.120
And since it's bamboo, it's light.

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:33.580
Yup, yup. It sure feels nice
when you've done a good deed.

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:42.700
Knock it off already with
making fun of me, you bastards!

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:44.450
Hold it right there!

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:46.010
Why, you...!

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:46.010
What's this commotion about?

00:04:56.620 --> 00:05:01.190
I had no idea you were so concerned
about having your own sword.

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:04.890
I'm very sorry. I'll accept any punishment.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:13.000
There's apparently a small festival
going on at the shrine across the bridge.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.330
You've done enough work for today.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:19.080
Take a break for once and
go enjoy yourself outside.

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:19.960
<i>But, sir...</i>...

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:20.910
<i>I know!</i>

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:23.910
<i>I think I'll have you buy me some
brown sugar candy while you're there!</i>

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:26.590
<i>I just love that cheap taste.</i>

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:30.100
<i>I understand.</i>

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:36.350
I am struck with admiration, Mr. Kondo.

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:40.410
Throwing something at the Commander
would ordinarily be punishable by seppuku.

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:44.900
And yet, instead of reproaching him,
you tell him to go take a break.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:49.080
Really, one could say it was
a brilliant Ohoka judgment.

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:50.620
Actually...
Yes?

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:53.870
If Toshi were to find out, well, you know,

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:56.950
that I couldn't even dodge
something thrown by a page,

00:05:56.950 --> 00:06:01.790
he would reprimand me as well,
saying it's proof I've grown soft.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:03.000
Mr. Kondo...

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.810
Rice Cakes

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.810
Dumplings

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:22.820
A festival? It's really just a
bunch of street stalls lined up.

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:27.910
Mama, buy me a sword! A sword!

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:29.700
I bought you one the other day, remember?

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:33.200
No! I mean a cooler one!

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.540
A cooler one?

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:35.660
Damn.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:38.660
Let's see...

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:41.790
Brown sugar candy, brown sugar candy...

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:47.920
Candy

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:46.330
Mister, I want to buy some stuff!

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:47.920
Sure thing, what'll it be?

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:49.340
Let's see...

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:52.010
There they are!

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:52.910
I want those...

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:56.060
Give me all the brown
sugar candy you have left!

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:58.160
Here you go, you lucked out.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:00.870
The brown sugar candy that
I've got out here is the last of it.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:02.270
Wait a minute!

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.660
I want brown sugar candy too!

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.410
You heard me, didn't you?

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:08.620
That little lady there's bought
the last of what I've got.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:11.040
I was asked to buy them
by an important person!

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:12.200
Sorry about this.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.410
Hey!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:16.120
Oh, if you really want them that bad,

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:19.370
I'll make a special exception
and give you one, little boy.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.700
One won't do me any good!

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:24.660
And I'm not a little boy, I'm...

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.450
Hey, it's you, Saya!

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:33.550
Well, I never would have guessed
that you were Saya's friend.

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.830
Then, half and half, okay?

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:38.750
It's all right. You got
there first, after all.

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:41.080
Come on, don't say that.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.450
Thanks.

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:47.250
My shamisen teacher likes them,
so I got them as a souvenir, but...

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:49.660
If that's the case, I really don't need it.

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.360
No, it's okay.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.200
My teacher's pretty senile,

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:57.740
and she can't even tell the difference
between brown sugar candy and mint candy!

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.080
Then I'll gratefully accept them.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:06.410
But a shamisen teacher? I had no idea
you two were taking lessons like that.

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:10.590
What? But that's what our customers...

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.220
What is it, Saya?

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:19.520
Oh, right, I haven't paid my
respects to the shrine yet!

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:20.720
You too, Saya?

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:25.850
All right, then you want
to do that thing together?

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:30.160
Peaceful, isn't it?

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:32.490
Yeah, peaceful.

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:36.790
The Choshu haven't been making
any open moves lately either,

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:41.290
so there's really not much
to do in patrolling the town.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:44.910
By the way, about puppy boy...

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:48.450
Oh, maybe we took things
a bit too far this morning.

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:49.370
You said it.

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:56.430
That reminds me, I have a short sword
that I'm not using in the closet.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.910
Hey, then, Shinpachi...

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:04.040
Well, it couldn't hurt to make
puppy boy happy for once, right?

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:07.330
A festival?

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:09.110
Shall we go take a peek?

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:12.350
As they say, where there are people,
there's information.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:21.950
What are you two going to pray...?

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.580
Here we go, Saya.

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:32.090
There!

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:42.040
We did it, Saya.

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:45.560
What was that?!

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:50.700
Doing this is supposed to increase
the chances of your wish coming true.

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:51.770
For real?!

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:54.540
It's just something my
old man made up, though.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.450
You have a funny father.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:59.780
Yeah, he was a fun person.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:03.540
Oh, could it be...?

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.080
It's okay, really.

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:07.870
And it seems Saya's in the same boat as me.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.080
But just because your
mother and father are gone,

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.700
you can't just stay depressed forever.

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:14.420
Saya isn't the only one!

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:18.380
My place is the same.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:26.410
But mine wasn't a fun
father like yours was.

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:27.950
Sorry.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.650
It's all right!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:35.480
Anyway, since we're all here together,
let's go look at the shops together. Okay?

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:39.320
Yeah, moping won't get us anywhere.

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:40.830
Let's go look.

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:44.370
Wait, Saya.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:50.220
I guess Tetsunosuke's been through
some rough times, just like us.

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:53.870
I've decided!

00:10:55.400 --> 00:11:00.010
I'll take the place of
Tetsunosuke's mother for today!

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:04.330
What'll I do if he goes, "Mother!"
and tries to act all spoiled?!

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.010
Tetsunosuke!

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:17.690
Don't be in such a hurry! Wait up!

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:24.410
Ring Toss

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:27.620
Now, what should I aim for?

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:31.080
What is it, Saya?

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:34.630
Oh, you want that piglet?

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:37.450
He looks kind of like Saizo!

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:40.030
All right, just watch...
Tetsunosuke!

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:45.390
I want that red hairpin over there!

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:48.140
Oh, that hairpin?

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:49.920
That's just like a girl.

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:56.270
Right, the piglet too.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.700
Hairpin!

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:01.700
Oh, hairpin, right?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.280
Piglet, right?

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:05.370
Hurry!

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:06.620
Hairpin...

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.040
Piglet, right?

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.040
Hairpin, right?

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:13.610
I know! The pig, right?!

00:12:13.610 --> 00:12:14.680
No, the hairpin!

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:16.660
I know already!

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:17.830
Wait a minute!

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:20.040
Hairpin! Hairpin! Hairpin!

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:22.050
Oh, man, to hell with it all!

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:24.890
Mister, give me some rings!

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:30.620
As they say, even a poor shot will
score a hit if he shoots enough.

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:32.160
You gotta just do these things with spirit!

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:33.600
Good luck!

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:34.520
Behold!

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:39.610
Tetsunosuke Ichimura Style,
Wild Dance of Arcs!

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.490
So it didn't work.

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:02.370
We have a winner!

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:03.970
I did it!

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:10.100
This thing sure is well-made
for being so small.

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:14.040
Look, it's actually properly
sheathed in the scabbard.

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:15.690
What?

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:20.620
Oh, I'm sorry about that, you two.

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:25.630
It's not really in apology,
but have some dumplings.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.240
They're pretty good.

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:31.840
Okay, thanks.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.880
If you're okay with this, you want it?

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:41.100
No.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:45.260
Could it be that you hate swords?

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:51.010
My dad was one of those umbrella-maker
ronin you often hear about.

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.290
He wasn't even in anyone's service,

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:57.050
but he was always strict about appearances,
talking about a warrior's pride and such.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:02.520
Mom got sick and we didn't even
have the money to call a doctor,

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:05.610
but he never would sell
his swords, to the very end.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.030
I had no idea.

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:12.950
But you know, I think that's
exactly why I understand

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.580
the sorrow of a child without parents.
Hey...

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:16.500
Tetsunosuke!

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:21.500
You can think of me as your
mother for today! Wait...

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.840
What are you talking about
all of a sudden, Hana?!

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:28.080
Oh, there's sweet red bean paste
from the dumpling around your mouth.

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:29.590
You don't have to do that!

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:33.430
I know! You must be thirsty after
having those dumplings, right?

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:35.830
I'll go buy something to drink.

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:37.330
Is a sweet ginger drink or something okay?

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:40.160
I'm not really thirsty.
You don't have to stand on ceremony!

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:41.600
Well, I'm off!

00:14:43.950 --> 00:14:47.660
Hana's an awfully energetic girl.

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.200
Saya?

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.830
But it's interesting.

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.410
Her personality's totally
the opposite of yours, Saya.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:59.290
Where did you get to know her?
Is she from your neighborhood?

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.290
Then, like at a temple school?

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.220
Well, I guess it doesn't matter.

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:22.590
But you know, I got to be friends with you,
but I don't know a whole lot about you, Saya.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:24.760
Saya...

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:29.860
If it's okay with you, next time...

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:35.040
Don't mess with us!

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:38.040
These are my best clothes!
What are you gonna do about it, eh?

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:41.830
That's why I've been apologizing
over and over, haven't I?!

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:45.000
Look, you spilled a sticky
sweet ginger drink all over it!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.420
Man, you better pay for it!

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:50.700
Sure, it's partly my fault
for bumping into you,

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:54.050
but it's your own fault, too,
for drinking in the middle of the street!

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.160
What'd you say?!

00:15:56.160 --> 00:15:57.970
Go call your parents over!

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:00.930
I don't have any...

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:04.690
It <i>is </i>Hana!

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:07.250
That girl, poor thing.

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:09.910
She sure got caught by
some unsavory characters.

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:11.820
Someone go help her out.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.090
It'd be bad to go up against those guys!

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:25.160
It'll be all right.

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:28.090
I won't mess up like I did the other day.

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:29.800
Okay, I'm going.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:32.410
There's this fun and happy
festival going on here,

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:34.960
and here's a couple of
guys acting like brutes.

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:37.680
Who the hell're you guys?!

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:43.600
Three men all working together to
bully one girl? Can't overlook that.

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:45.650
Those guys...

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:49.410
What they've got on their
hips might look impressive,

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.200
but they're probably just
ronin from somewhere.

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:55.490
This isn't the era of
samurai anymore! Butt out!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:59.540
Well, yeah, I suppose we <i>are </i>ronin.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:01.000
No doubt about it.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:04.370
Anyway, won't you let that girl go?

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.080
You gotta be kidding!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:10.370
Look how well she's dressed!
No way she doesn't have parents!

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:13.290
I've been telling you I
don't have any parents!

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:16.050
Shut up! Hurry up and take us to them!

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:16.680
Hold it!

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:23.540
What're you gonna do? Chop us
apart with that thing on your hip?

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.410
I dare you to try it!

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:26.830
There's no need for that.

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:27.480
What?!

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:31.320
He's saying you guys aren't
even worth drawing against.

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:33.310
What'd you say?!

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:43.910
All talk.

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:45.870
Bastard!

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:51.600
Damn it!

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:53.390
You're not going anywhere.

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:57.200
Listen closely, you guys.

00:17:57.200 --> 00:18:01.330
What you've got on your hip,
or what kinds of swords you've got,

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.250
doesn't matter one bit.

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:06.700
What we did has to do with
how we can't just overlook it

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.540
when you guys are bullying someone weaker.

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:09.730
That's right.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:12.300
Damn! Don't you forget this!

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:18.040
Oh, man. "Don't you forget this"?
What a typical line.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:19.150
You said it.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:23.920
Are you okay?

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:25.410
Yes.

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:28.040
Then go enjoy the festival.

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:29.450
Okay!

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:33.700
Everyone, sorry for the commotion.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:36.580
Hana...
Oh, Tetsunosuke.

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:39.540
Sorry, I was going to get
involved to help you,

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:42.000
but those guys beat me to the punch.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.010
Those guys?

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:46.370
Yeah, I know them,

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.410
but they're hopeless, don't you think?

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:50.560
Making the whole commotion
into such a big deal.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:53.630
So cool...

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:55.610
Tetsunosuke!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:59.450
Introduce me to that tall person!

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:04.910
I had no idea there were
samurai like him out there!

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:09.540
He had an impressive sword by his side,
but he said that didn't matter one bit!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.920
No, well, he did, but...

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:16.960
What a huge difference compared to my dad.

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:20.010
I've decided!

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:23.720
I'm going to become his bride!

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:27.720
What's so funny, Saya?

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:33.240
Right? You'll cheer me on too,
won't you? Right, right?

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:36.120
Good grief.
Right? Right, right?

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.540
What?! We're going home already?!

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:40.070
You had a whole lot to eat, didn't you?

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:42.830
Aren't you going to buy me a sword?

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:44.540
Next time, okay?

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:45.680
Excuse me...

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:49.750
You can have this if you want it.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:52.330
What?! For real?!

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:53.830
Are you sure about this?

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:54.500
Yeah.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.210
There's no use in me keeping it, so...

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.950
All right!

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:00.570
Thank you very much.

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:02.910
Isn't that great?

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:03.550
Look!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:06.640
Tetsunosuke, what're you doing?!

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:10.810
Hurry up and tell me that
person's name and where he lives!

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:16.080
I'm gonna become his bride, no matter what!

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:22.610
There, that should make you happy.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.920
There? But this is...

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:28.870
Just gratefully accept it.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:31.250
I know it looks a little raggedy,

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.200
but Shinpachi and I discussed it,

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:38.090
and thought we'd give you your own
sword in secret from Mr. Hijikata.

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:40.830
You just called it raggedy, didn't you?

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:42.950
Did I say that?

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:43.870
Yeah, you did!

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:47.000
Hey, hey, there's no way
I'd say something like that!

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:52.560
Oh, are you so moved that
you're speechless, puppy boy?

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:57.560
If you're that overjoyed,
I'm happy about it!

00:20:57.910 --> 00:20:58.860
I don't need it.

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:01.820
Oh, is that right?! You don't need it?!

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:06.330
Wait! What?!

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:07.700
Why not?!

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:10.370
You saying you can't accept
one that's so ragged?!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.580
I'm telling you, it's not ragged!

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:15.620
I thought about it a lot,

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:19.590
and I don't mind if I have to
wait a little longer for a sword.

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:21.280
What?!

00:21:21.910 --> 00:21:24.250
Do you have a fever or something?

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:28.660
Or are you worried about
if Mr. Hijikata finds out?

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:30.510
You remember what you said?

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:36.020
That what you've got on your
hip doesn't actually matter.

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:40.910
Hey, Saizo!

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:44.910
Hold on, I'll get you some food.

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:47.250
What the heck's gotten into him?

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:48.280
No idea.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:52.240
All right! I'm gonna get through
today doing the best I can again!

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:07.910
