00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:28.920
Next Peacemaker Kurogane

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:28.920
<i>So, puppy boy
isn't going to be around next week?</i>

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:30.520
<i>Something about an errand
for the Vice Commander.</i>

00:23:30.520 --> 00:23:32.370
<i>Yeah, I heard he's going
swimming in the sea!</i>

00:23:32.370 --> 00:23:33.890
<i>Like hell I am!</i>

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:37.180
<i>Next time, Peacemaker Kurogane,
Chapter 9: "Ryo."</i>

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:40.700
